[{"op":"callScene","scene":6900,"entry":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":22},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":2},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":9,"condition":["==",["v","f",11],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":6422,"entry":0},{"op":"goto","to":135},{"op":"background","image":"bg012"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",303],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天也和平时一样迟到了。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":17,"condition":["==",["v","f",10],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（这才是我习惯的生活…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（唉，真是忙乱的一周…）"},{"op":"goto","to":21},{"op":"ifFalse","to":21,"condition":["==",["v","f",10],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我又叹了口气…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后独自攀登起，空无一人的坡道。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":24,"condition":["==",["v","f",213],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":2422,"entry":0},{"op":"goto","to":33},{"op":"ifFalse","to":33,"condition":["==",["v","f",213],0]},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"穿过正在聊天的学生，来到自己的座位。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"把书包放上桌，找椅子坐了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和往常一样，我的邻座没人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我决定靠眺望窗外来打发时间。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":40,"condition":["==",["v","f",410],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":4422,"entry":0},{"op":"goto","to":135},{"op":"background","image":"bg021e"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「今天午饭去食堂解决？」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":46,"condition":["==",["v","f",213],1]},{"op":"goto","to":80},{"op":"ifFalse","to":49,"condition":["==",["v","f",804],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以说，别说得好像你一直在这里似的，你刚刚才来的吧？」"},{"op":"goto","to":51},{"op":"ifFalse","to":51,"condition":["==",["v","f",804],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别说得好像你一直在这里似的，你刚刚才来的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「算是啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要约饭的话，好歹也提前跟我招呼一下。不然我的计划都要打乱了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「问题是，现在已经不是说早安的时间了啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「的确不是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那你要我怎样啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这个嘛…」"},{"op":"choice","id":"422:40240","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"改说午安","value":0,"serial":40240},{"text":"加点特别的反应","value":1,"serial":40250},{"text":"先来个自我介绍","value":2,"serial":40260}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":64,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「都已经是中午了，要说也应该说午安吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，你说的是。明天开始就这么说吧。」"},{"op":"goto","to":77},{"op":"ifFalse","to":74,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「见到我时要加点特别的反应。这个是不能少的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要什么样的反应啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么都行，你看着办啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我举个例子…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「咦，这不是冈崎吗？好久不见，你还好吗？我很好。诸如此类的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，确实有好久不见的感觉。那下次开始我就这么做吧。」"},{"op":"goto","to":77},{"op":"ifFalse","to":77,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「先来个自我介绍。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「虽然不清楚这是为什么，但如果你硬要说这才合规矩的话，那下次开始我就这么做吧。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",813],"value":["v","f",1089]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那么，今天午饭去食堂解决？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要是你请客的话，出去解决也行。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你抢了我想说的台词。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈哈，我们都是穷鬼。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别随随便便跟我站队。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg025"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「人好多啊…要不买个面包就回去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要不找份打工吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「晚上的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「晚上打工白天上学，体力会吃不消的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不去找那种体力劳动的工作不就行了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「比如说，那种用脑子的工作。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我想想…家庭教师是不是很赞？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你能教人些什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我告诉你，其实我英语可牛了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「I am pretty dog.」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「Oh!Are you pretty dog too?」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「It's miracle!」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那啥，狗会说话本身就是奇迹了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么样？我的发音够完美吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「能吐槽的地方太多，反而不知道怎么吐槽了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这就叫做完美。冇问题啦！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这是广东话吧。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021e"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「说白了，学生都是些穷鬼。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这么明摆着的事不用你提醒。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":125,"condition":["==",["v","f",214],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":2422,"entry":1},{"op":"goto","to":135},{"op":"ifFalse","to":135,"condition":["==",["v","f",214],0]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":133,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","f",500],1],["==",["v","f",501],1]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":130,"condition":["==",["v","f",504],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":5422,"entry":0},{"op":"goto","to":132},{"op":"ifFalse","to":132,"condition":["==",["v","f",504],0]},{"op":"callScene","scene":5421,"entry":0},{"op":"goto","to":135},{"op":"ifFalse","to":135,"condition":["||",["==",["v","f",500],0],["==",["v","f",501],0]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听着春原源源不断的蠢话，午休时间就结束了。"},{"op":"callScene","scene":3422,"entry":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021h"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等到班会结束，到了放学的时候。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":176,"condition":["==",["v","f",214],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":2422,"entry":2},{"op":"ifFalse","to":175,"condition":["==",["v","f",215],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我看看…时间还很充裕，等会儿陪我出去一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原重新打起精神，向我说到。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":151,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「又要我去听你弹吉他？」"},{"op":"goto","to":153},{"op":"ifFalse","to":153,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还去游戏厅啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不不，这次可不一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有事快说。顺便说我没钱。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「从现在开始，我的房间将变得十分信息化。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么说…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我要去向２年级的人借电视机和录像机。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这还真够信息化的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「另外，你双手都骨折了还这么拼啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「而且那家伙还是个发烧友…有很多套录像带。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不好，说不定会害得我不想来上学…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「从明天开始，我改叫你为春原黄平吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别这么说嘛，小哥你也好这一口的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，虽说我不讨厌…但两个大男人肩并肩看黄带不觉得很那啥？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈哈，到时候谁牺牲一下，到外头去晃一圈就行啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这种方法真讨厌…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我们走吧！」"},{"op":"goto","to":279},{"op":"goto","to":691},{"op":"ifFalse","to":180,"condition":["==",["v","f",11],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":6422,"entry":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",814],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":279},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「太好啦，上完啦！」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":191,"condition":["==",["v","f",410],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你只是一直在睡觉吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「算是吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「顺便一提，梦里我也和你在一起嬉戏！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你做这么肉麻的梦干什么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说，今天放学陪我出去一下。」"},{"op":"goto","to":198},{"op":"ifFalse","to":198,"condition":["==",["v","f",410],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么忽然就精神十足的了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好啦，对我们而言，生活是从放学后才开始的对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别把我和你混为一谈。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那么，让我们开始享受快乐的放学时间吧！」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":201,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「又要我去听你弹吉他？」"},{"op":"goto","to":203},{"op":"ifFalse","to":203,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还去游戏厅啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不不，这次可不一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有事快说。顺便说我没钱。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「从现在开始，我的房间将变得十分信息化。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么说…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我要去向２年级的人借电视机和录像机。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这还真够信息化的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「而且那家伙还是个发烧友…有很多套录像带。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不好，说不定会害得我不想来上学…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「从明天开始，我改叫你为春原黄平吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别这么说嘛，小哥你也好这一口的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，虽说我不讨厌…但两个大男人肩并肩看黄带不觉得很那啥？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈哈，到时候谁牺牲一下，到外头去晃一圈就行啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这种方法真讨厌…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我们走吧！」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":270,"condition":["==",["v","f",410],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原拿起书包走出了教室。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":235,"condition":["==",["v","f",805],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你不一起来吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又跑回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「麻烦。」"},{"op":"goto","to":252},{"op":"ifFalse","to":242,"condition":["==",["v","f",805],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你不一起来吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说，同一个梗重复用就没意思了吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又跑回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不是玩梗。我只是觉得麻烦。」"},{"op":"goto","to":252},{"op":"ifFalse","to":252,"condition":["==",["v","f",805],2]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgts10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"幸村","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"幸村","text":"「…不来么。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么样，吓一跳吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别干这种无聊的事情…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我说…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",805],"value":["+",["v","f",805],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你其实也很想看的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「并不。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别那么冷漠，帮兄弟一把啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我可不想抱着电视机和录像机走路啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「去找别人帮忙吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哼…你说的哦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我知道了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「装好了我也绝不会让冈崎你看的ー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像个赌气的小孩子般跑开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呼…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（好，我该走了…）"},{"op":"callScene","scene":4422,"entry":1},{"op":"goto","to":691},{"op":"ifFalse","to":279,"condition":["==",["v","f",128],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":1422,"entry":0},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「冈崎你在发什么呆啊，我不等你了哦！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原在走廊另一头招呼道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「知道了，这就来…」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":410,"condition":["==",["v","f",814],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg012y"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":4},{"op":"ifFalse","to":286,"condition":["==",["v","f",128],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和古河一起往坡下走去。"},{"op":"goto","to":288},{"op":"ifFalse","to":288,"condition":["==",["v","f",128],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚走下坡道…"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哦，你来得正好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又碰上了春原。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么事。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「帮个忙。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":302,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「又要我去听你弹吉他？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不不，这次可不一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有事快说。顺便说我没钱。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"goto","to":304},{"op":"ifFalse","to":304,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「干什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「从现在开始，我的房间将变得十分信息化。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么说…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我要去向２年级的人借电视机和录像机。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这还真够信息化的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「而且那家伙还是个发烧友…有很多套录像带。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不好，说不定会害得我不想来上学…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「从明天开始，我改叫你为春原黄平吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别这么说嘛，小哥你也好这一口的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，虽说我不讨厌…但两个大男人肩并肩看黄带不觉得很那啥？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈哈，到时候谁牺牲一下，到外头去晃一圈就行啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这种方法真讨厌…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我们走吧！」"},{"op":"choice","id":"422:42040","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"帮他","value":0,"serial":42040},{"text":"不帮他","value":1,"serial":42050}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":338,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":337,"condition":["==",["v","f",128],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「拿你没辙…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我转向在一旁默默等着的古河。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「古河，下次见。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「好的，请多加油。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她好像并没弄清楚我们打算去借什么东西。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么加油？加油看黄带？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「闭上你的嘴。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我们走！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我踹了春原的后背一脚。"},{"op":"goto","to":410},{"op":"ifFalse","to":410,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原一个人走掉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":350,"condition":["==",["v","f",805],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你不一起来吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又跑回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「麻烦。」"},{"op":"goto","to":367},{"op":"ifFalse","to":357,"condition":["==",["v","f",805],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你不一起来吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说，同一个梗重复用就没意思了吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又跑回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不是玩梗。我只是觉得麻烦。」"},{"op":"goto","to":367},{"op":"ifFalse","to":367,"condition":["==",["v","f",805],2]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgts10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"幸村","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"幸村","text":"「…不来么。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么样，吓一跳吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别干这种无聊的事情…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",805],"value":["+",["v","f",805],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你其实也很想看的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「并不。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别那么冷漠，帮兄弟一把啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我可不想抱着电视机和录像机走路啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「去找别人帮忙吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哼…你说的哦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我知道了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「装好了我也绝不会让冈崎你看的ー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像个赌气的小孩子般跑开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呼…」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":389,"condition":["==",["v","f",128],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「回去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我转向在一旁默默等着的古河。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"goto","to":391},{"op":"ifFalse","to":391,"condition":["==",["v","f",128],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回去吧。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":408,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg046n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"晚上我照例来到了春原的房间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「来看录像吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「等等，没见到有啊。怎么回事？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「还不是因为你冷血无情不肯帮忙！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那么重的东西，我一个人怎么可能搬得动。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊ー啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原百无聊赖地瘫倒在地板上。"},{"op":"goto","to":663},{"op":"goto","to":410},{"op":"ifFalse","to":410,"condition":["==",["v","f",612],0]},{"op":"goto","to":691},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",815],"value":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":523,"condition":["==",["v","f",320],1]},{"op":"choice","id":"422:42680","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"帮忙","value":0,"serial":42680},{"text":"不帮他","value":1,"serial":42690}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":416,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",320],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":523},{"op":"ifFalse","to":523,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原一个人走掉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":428,"condition":["==",["v","f",805],0]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你不一起来